Subject: [PATCH] batch 177 (R36): block predicates stage their query offset in
 a thread-local mutable (PapoPredicateScratch) instead of allocating
 pos.offset(this.offset) per test (StateTestingPredicate 116 census trips +
 HasSturdyFacePredicate 18 - predicates run per candidate position of every
 predicate-gated placement; queries are coordinate-read-only so the reusable
 scratch is unobservable) + OreFeature.doPlace hoists the
 bulkSectionAccess::getBlockState bound method reference out of the loop nest
 (146 trips: it was created per candidate position and per target state; one
 accessor per doPlace is identical)


diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/levelgen/blockpredicates/HasSturdyFacePredicate.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/levelgen/blockpredicates/HasSturdyFacePredicate.java
